{"id":"n15702-2-9","stage":2,"title":"비비다 · 拌","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15702-2-9-1","ko":"입맛이 없어.","zh":"我没什么胃口。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"입맛이","meaning":"口味，胃口，食欲","explanation":"입맛：口味，胃口，食欲；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"입맛","audio":"/audio/b0e5bfd702c70372139f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24617","senseId":"1","lemma":"입맛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없어.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"4","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b0e5bfd702c70372","term":"입맛","zh":"口味，胃口，食欲","audio":"/audio/b0e5bfd702c70372139f.mp3","entryId":"24617","definition":"吃食物使嘴里感受到的味道，或指想吃食物的欲望。","pronunciation":["임맏"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"某物不多。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/acd5ea3f4d975b286283.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15702-2-9-2","ko":"나물에 밥을 비벼 먹을까?","zh":"要把饭拌着野菜一起吃吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나물에","meaning":"拌菜，凉拌菜","explanation":"나물：拌菜，凉拌菜；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"나물","audio":"/audio/801e9b0adcd7aa82acf3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38848","senseId":"2","lemma":"나물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밥을","meaning":"饭","explanation":"밥：饭；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62683","senseId":"1","lemma":"밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비벼","meaning":"拌","explanation":"비비다：拌；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"비비다","audio":"/audio/1b28e62871e3ac43fd9a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15702","senseId":"2","lemma":"비비다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹을까?","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；을까：非敬